guide forever/class/druid/bloodpetal-poison
title Bloodpetal Poison
category Class
folder Druid
keywords Torwa Pathfinder, Bloodpetal Poison, Toxic Test, A Better Ingredient, Putrid Vine, Atal'alarion, Sunken Temple, Devilsaur, Gorishi Sting, Bloodcap, Un'Goro Crater, Loganaar, class quest
reward item 13446
why Experience in Un'Goro at 50 and two healing potions; the Classic item choice may be gone in Forever.
class Druid
levels 50-54
zone Un'Goro Crater

# The level-52 druid quests in Un'Goro Crater: Torwa Pathfinder (9063, from
# Loganaar in Nighthaven; Turak Runetotem, Mathrengyl Bearwalker and
# Theridran offer it too) -> Bloodpetal Poison (9052: 8 Gorishi Stings, 8
# Bloodcap) -> Toxic Test (9051: stab a Devilsaur with the Devilsaur Barb) ->
# A Better Ingredient (9053: the Putrid Vine from Atal'alarion, the guardian
# at the bottom of the Sunken Temple).
# Forever's druid class quest list says A Better Ingredient no longer gives
# its choice (Forest's Embrace, Grizzled Pelt, Moonshadow Stave), but the
# same quest page still lists three unnamed choice items (22274, 22272,
# 22458): the card counts on the experience and Bloodpetal Poison's two Major
# Healing Potions. Devilsaurs are elite and Atal'alarion is a dungeon boss:
# bring a group for both.
# INGAME: does A Better Ingredient (9053) still offer Forest's Embrace, Grizzled Pelt or Moonshadow Stave on Forever? The change notes say no; the quest page still lists the three item ids.
# ASSUMED: the chain, Torwa's camp and Atal'alarion's statue puzzle are as in Classic (Classic flow; Forever's data has no server answer or play report above 30 for 9051-9063). In-game check: Torwa at the foot of the ramp and the statue order.
# Drops and gotchas from Forever's quest notes: Gorishi Sting 15% (wasps and
# stingers), Bloodcap 50% per sprout, three Devilsaur spawns (10 min), the
# barb leaves the Devilsaur hostile; the Sunken Temple statue order.
# Based on data, not play: the beta stops at level 30, so none of this could
# be checked in game before launch (4 November).
# Sources: quests.json, npcs.json, objects.json and items.json (Questie
# 12.1.0, Forever); the Sunken Temple entrance is the point
# forever/alliance/40-50/07-un-goro-crater uses (a public Sunken Temple
# dungeon guide gives 69,53 in the Swamp of Sorrows; the way in from several
# walkthroughs).
# Left out, though Forever's quest data has them (tooltip found) and the
# data marks them questie-forever: The Emerald Dream (7506: a Dire Maul book
# drop; its ender, Lorekeeper Javon, has no position in the data) and the
# raid and dungeon gear exchanges, which are not class chains: the Zul'Gurub
# Paragons of Power and kelp quests (8057, 8064, 8065, 8110-8113),
# Animist's Caress (8192), Armaments of War (8382), the Ahn'Qiraj quests
# (8665-8669, 8692, 8700, 8708), the Dungeon Set 2 chain (8905, 8913, 8926,
# 8927, 8951, 8999, 9007, 9016), the Naxxramas Dreamwalker and Polar pieces
# (9086-9093, 9241-9243) and Atiesh (9250, 9251, 9269).

step Loganaar
  zone Moonglade
  tip Cast Teleport: Moonglade. Loganaar stands in Nighthaven; your class trainer (Turak Runetotem, Mathrengyl Bearwalker or Theridran in Stormwind) offers the same quest.
  level 50
  accept 9063 npc 12042                 -- Loganaar

step Torwa Pathfinder
  zone Un'Goro Crater
  tip Fly to Gadgetzan, ride west to the long ramp down into Un'Goro Crater: Torwa camps at its foot, in the south-east corner of the crater.
  turnin 9063                           -- Torwa Pathfinder
  accept 9052

step Gorishi Stings and Bloodcap
  tip Eight of each. The Gorishi Wasps and Stingers (level 51-52) in and around the Slithering Scar, the hive in the south-west of the crater, drop a sting about one kill in seven; the wasps share spawn points with the other bugs, so kill whatever stands near you to make room for more wasps (respawn five minutes). The bugs' Silithid Pox makes you take more physical damage for 30 minutes; Workers call for help when hurt. The Bloodpetal Sprouts grow all over the crater (around Marshal's Refuge and the western half): open them, about every other one gives a Bloodcap, back in three to five minutes.
  collect 22435 x8 quest 9052.1         -- Gorishi Sting
  collect 22434 x8 quest 9052.2         -- Bloodcap

step Torwa Pathfinder
  turnin 9052                           -- Torwa Pathfinder
  accept 9051

step Toxic Test
  tip Any Devilsaur counts, the Ironhide and Tyrant Devilsaurs too. They are elite (level 54-55), hit with Mighty Blow and outrun travel form. Grouping up is encouraged, but a druid can do it alone: Hibernate or Entangling Roots it from range, stab it with the Devilsaur Barb (the barb does not break Hibernate), then leave. The credit counts the moment the barb lands, even if you die after. The arrow points at the plain Devilsaurs of the west and north; an Ironhide Devilsaur roams the middle of the crater's south, nearer Torwa.
  kill 6498 quest 9051.1 "Stab a Devilsaur with the Devilsaur Barb" -- Devilsaur: stab it with the Devilsaur Barb

step Torwa Pathfinder
  turnin 9051                           -- Torwa Pathfinder
  accept 9053

step The Sunken Temple
  zone Swamp of Sorrows
  tip A five-player dungeon: needs a group of five, about level 50-55. Horde: fly to Stonard; Alliance: fly to Nethergarde Keep in the Blasted Lands and ride north. The Temple of Atal'Hakkar stands in the middle of the Pool of Tears in the Swamp of Sorrows: climb the stairs on the ruin's south side, dive into the flooded hall, swim down through it and follow the stairs and passages down to the portal. Atal'alarion (level 50 elite, Sweeping Slam and Ground Tremor) only appears when the six serpent statues on the balcony ring above the altar pit are clicked in order: South, North, South-west, South-east, North-west, North-east (each turns green when right; a wrong order fails). Clear the trash by each statue and the pit below first; jumping down into the water is the quick way down, but a knockback near the edge can kill. The Putrid Vine always drops.
  goto 69.9,53.6 "The Temple of Atal'Hakkar"
  collect 22444 quest 9053.1 @69.9,53.6 group 5 -- Putrid Vine: Atal'alarion

step A Better Ingredient
  zone Un'Goro Crater
  tip Back to Torwa in the south-east corner of Un'Goro Crater.
  turnin 9053                           -- Torwa Pathfinder: the old item choice may be gone, count on the experience
